> 
Custom rules (pick a line to change it)
 1) Board                : 8x8, 12 men each
 2) Mandatory capture    : off
 3) Longest capture first: off
 4) Flying kings         : off
 5) Men capture backwards: off
 6) Men move backwards   : off
 7) A man is crowned     : as soon as it reaches the last row
 8) Jumped pieces go     : at once
